<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 142,425.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 142,425.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Feb 13 totaled 142,425 bales, up from 135,707 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 6,718 bales issued, 8,815 decertification orders, no cancellations, and 15,385 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>(( -- New York Commodities Desk 212 859 1640))</p>
</text>
